config BR2_PACKAGE_AR8030
	bool "ar8030"
	help
	  Artosyn AR8030 baseband/RF-link kernel driver (artosyn_drv.ko)
	  for the Caddx VRX Pro's internal USB-attached RF module.

	  Includes the GPIO power-on sequence, firmware+config for the
	  CX486-RF-2PA RF board, and the init script that brings the link
	  up on boot. See package/ar8030-tools for the userspace daemon
	  and pairing/diagnostic tools that talk to it.
